  "description": "Introduction\n\nThose familiar with us know that we stand out in our respective fields with the ultralight SLC and the aerodynamic T1550. But what if there’s something that bridges the gap between the two? Something that’s both aerodynamic and lightweight. While it’s said that you can’t have the best of both worlds, our Agile model begs to differ. It offers superb handling and is fully UCI certified, currently available only in a disc brake version.\n\nFeatures\n\nHorizontal Angled T-Tail\n\nWith the T-tail design, we’ve tweaked the aerodynamic profile of our T series slightly. The horizontal extension maximizes aerodynamic efficiency, while the angled tail-end creates a sweet spot, perfectly balancing aerodynamics and riding comfort.\n\nT800+T1000 Carbon Fiber EPS+LATEX Molding Process\n\nThe Agile frameset steps up the game with a T800+T1000 carbon fiber EPS+LATEX molding process, elevating stability and maintaining a remarkably lightweight structure. This advanced technique ensures the frame not only meets but exceeds rigidity standards, promising durability and longevity. The strategic blend of T800 and T1000 carbon fibers significantly enhances the bike’s structural integrity and strength, empowering you to ride with unmatched speed and efficiency.\n\nEnhanced Compatibility and Ultimate Control.\n\nAgile caters to diverse cycling needs with its T47 bottom bracket compatibility and the ability to support tire clearance up to 32mm, offering a broad spectrum of customization and adaptability to different scenarios. The crafted trail value endows it with superior handling limits, ensuring immediate steering and acceleration, fostering a harmonious unity between rider and bike.\n\nPaint Job Options\n\nGeometry",
